1
00:00:00,678 --> 00:00:02,248
(Bernadette:)Can I ask you something?

2
00:00:02,413 --> 00:00:04,913
(Bernadette:)Why do you constantly feel
the need to put down my husband?

3
00:00:05,082 --> 00:00:06,722
(Penny:)I'm sure he does it out of love.

4
00:00:06,884 --> 00:00:08,764
(Penny:)The same way my boyfriend
makes me feel terrible

5
00:00:08,919 --> 00:00:10,559
(Penny:)about my life choices.

6
00:00:13,257 --> 00:00:14,757
(Amy:)I think we're gonna go.

7
00:00:15,592 --> 00:00:17,432
(Leonard:)No, no. This is not a fight.

8
00:00:17,594 --> 00:00:20,504
(Leonard:)I was just excited that
someone offered you a part

9
00:00:20,664 --> 00:00:22,404
(Leonard:)and a little surprised
that you'd rather sit at home

10
00:00:22,566 --> 00:00:23,906
(Leonard:)and do nothing than take it.

11
00:00:28,439 --> 00:00:29,679
(Leonard:)Now it's a fight.

12
00:00:31,542 --> 00:00:32,882
(Sheldon:)Well, with that sorted out,

13
00:00:33,043 --> 00:00:34,713
(Sheldon:)I'm happy to answer your
question, Bernadette.

14
00:00:34,878 --> 00:00:36,418
(Sheldon:)Howard started it.

15
00:00:36,714 --> 00:00:38,624
(Howard:)I didn't do anything.
I was just sitting here.

16
00:00:38,782 --> 00:00:40,452
(Sheldon:)I wasn't referring to this evening.

17
00:00:40,617 --> 00:00:42,727
(Sheldon:)Ten years ago,
upon first seeing me,

18
00:00:42,886 --> 00:00:45,126
(Sheldon:)your husband claimed
that I looked like C-3PO

19
00:00:45,289 --> 00:00:46,929
(Sheldon:)and Pee-wee Herman.

20
00:00:49,426 --> 00:00:51,966
(Sheldon:)And he called me
C-3P-wee Herman.

21
00:00:54,732 --> 00:00:59,022
(Raj:)Still funny.

